<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech CNB-120 index rises 1 point to 911.5 pts.</title>
<headline>Czech CNB-120 index rises 1 point to 911.5 pts.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CNB-120 index, a broad daily measure of Czech equities, rose one point on Tuesday to 911.5, the Czech National Bank (CNB) said.</p>
<p>Four of the ten sectoral indices gained, with the machinery index rising most, up 18.1 points to 1,219.7.</p>
<p>Six indices lost, with the energy index losing most, down six points to 1,098.8.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
